# Sub-tick interpolation of the additive tracer ribbon
# (scripts/check_feeder_subtick.sh --path tracer).
#   <bk2> | <V> | blob=<x>,<y> ... [tol=<px>] [step=<px>] [astep=<px>] [cstep=<n>]
#
# The two legs are a render-path selection with and without the tracer path,
# terrain and moby in both.
#
# The source is not a movie: the plain boot's attract demo charges through
# Sunrise Spring at VBL 4500, the same present the presentation corpus pins as
# its tracer row. The ribbon is one 2272-2717 px component whose head crosses
# 21.9 px over the interval while its tail grows, so all three cells carry
# signal: the centroid is the head's translation, the area the ribbon's own
# length ramp, the mean colour its additive fade.
title-demo | 4500 | blob=285.0,202.0 tol=1.0 step=10
